      "No soundtrack bytes, catalogue identities, rights, transport, queue ordering, procedural recipes or payloads change."
    ],
    "limitations": [
      "Exact-source hosted qualification, frozen/public release and physical iPhone/controller/offline acceptance remain separate.",
      "This is a UI and persistence correction; it does not approve any recording or musical suitability."
    ]
